{"id":"5fa65e4ea7ccdaff","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice.md","title":"无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","display":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice","aliases":["72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice"],"display":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.3 and §3.1.1–3.1.2, print346–347,352/PDF358–359,364; explicit matrix calculation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.3 and §3.1.1–3.1.2, print346–347,352/PDF358–359,364; explicit matrix calculation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>，x:σ、y:τ 为指定变量，F:σ→τ 为新鲜变量；P 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Dialectica 矩阵与 w、c 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\">\\(f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\sigma\">\\(v:\\sigma\\)</span> 为新鲜挑战变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,Y\">\\(U,Y\\)</span> 由下式的封闭 λ 项构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.f,\\qquad\nY:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.\\lambda v^\\sigma:\\sigma.v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.f,\\qquad\nY:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.\\lambda v^\\sigma:\\sigma.v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w(P)=\\langle(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau),(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\n\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w(P)=\\langle(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau),(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\n\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0\\vdash P_D(U,Y;f,v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0\\vdash P_D(U,Y;f,v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前件 ∀x∃yθ 的实现者为 f，挑战为 v；后件 ∃F∀xθ(x,Fx) 的实现者也为函数、挑战也为 v。U 原样传递见证，Y 原样返回挑战。β 化简后的矩阵两边同为 θ(v,fv)，得到命题重言式 θ→θ。所有项适型，U、Y 封闭且不依赖 θ 的参数；没有在基础理论中证明 AC 本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ、y:τ 为指定变量，F:σ→τ 为新鲜变量；P 是 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] 的 $\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Dialectica 矩阵与 w、c 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]。$f:\\sigma\\to\\tau$、$v:\\sigma$ 为新鲜挑战变量；$U,Y$ 由下式的封闭 λ 项构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\sigma\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"U,Y","display":false},{"tex":"U:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.f,\\qquad\nY:=\\lambda f^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}:\\sigma\\to\\tau.\\lambda v^\\sigma:\\sigma.v.","display":true},{"tex":"w(P)=\\langle(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau),(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\n\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"T_0\\vdash P_D(U,Y;f,v).","display":true}],"bytes":1964,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-508","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexa